# Velo local environment — copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Never commit .env.local. Full list of optional keys: .env.example.

# Cesium ion access token — the photoreal 3D globe needs it.
# Federico creates this himself on the free personal tier:
#   https://ion.cesium.com/tokens  → "Create token" → default scopes are fine.
# Paste the token after the "=". No quotes, no spaces.
# Without it the app still runs: Home works, and the ride screen asks for a
# token in the browser (stored in localStorage under globeride.cesiumIonToken).
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
